      "text": "Carter Bryant will play sparingly at Summer League. Jayden Quaintance won't play at all. Tarris Reed Jr. is ready to flash his blue-collar credentials in a Spurs jersey.\n\nThose storylines and more to watch as the Spurs open Summer League today in San Francisco:\n\nwww.expressnews.com/sports/spurs...",
